      <div type="clause" n="41.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 41.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ buton he binnon XXX nihta bote agynne wið God ⁊ wið men, ðonne sy he utlaga.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And unless he begins to make amends both to God and men within 30 days, he shall be outlawed.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ butan he binnan XXX nihton bote aginne wið God ⁊ wið men, þonne si he utlah.</ab>
